  "sourceText": "Homemade Biscuit Mix\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 10, 2009 - 12:58am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 1/2 pounds all-purpose flour\n6 tablespoons baking powder\n3 1/2 teaspoons salt\n1 1/4 cups nonfat dry milk powder\n1 1/2 cups vegetable shortening\n6 tablespoons vegetable shortening\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix dry ingredients and cut in the shortening. Store in tightly covered container.",
